              description:
                'The strategy to use for resolving overlap of labels in gradient legends. If `false`, no overlap reduction is attempted. If set to `true` (default) or `"parity"`, a strategy of removing every other label is used. If set to `"greedy"`, a linear scan of the labels is performed, removing any label that overlaps with the last visible label (this often works better for log-scaled axes).\n\n__Default value:__ `true`.',
